data: {"id": "d1bbeef931d0433f-thinking-parallel_evidence-3481", "run_id": "d1bbeef931d0433f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据 `kubectl_describe` 的结果，根因已经清晰：Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 阶段是因为 **Multus CNI 插件无法找到指定的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` ('unavailable-network')**。\n\n### 证据事实汇总\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期状态**：\n   - 当前状态：**Pending** (Reason: **ContainerCreating**)\n   - 节点调度：**node2** (IP: 10.2.0.50)\n   - 镜像：`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine` (ImagePullPolicy: IfNotPresent)\n   - **无 imagePullSecrets**（但镜像尚未尝试拉取，因为卡在 CNI 阶段）\n\n2. **异常直接原因**（来自 kubectl_describe Events）：\n   - **事件类型**：FailedCreatePodSandBox\n   - *", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788783588761, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "d1bbeef931d0433f-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "d1bbeef931d0433f", "seq": 3482, "ts_ms": 1788783596888, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 44.063, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/d1bbeef931d0433f-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "5ca14a793b585d4e284cec4870a8167a5985b4a14de40c8cdc7ceac595e371cb", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "bea5d6f3fae128a00a34b41ae7a8841cf195e82511e87475c28e1dddabdd7991"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "d1bbeef931d0433f-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "d1bbeef931d0433f", "seq": 3483, "ts_ms": 1788783596889, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "d1bbeef931d0433f-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "d1bbeef931d0433f", "seq": 3484, "ts_ms": 1788783606139, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.25, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1803, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` | 确认 Pod 处于无法启动容器的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `Failed to create pod sandbox: ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 定位直接失败原因为 Multus CNI 插件未能找到网络配置 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound` (累计 46 次): `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 证实 Pod 反复尝试加载名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件但始终失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: 1 (reason: `ContainerCreating`) | 指标状态印证了容器持续处于等待网络配置的原因 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nPod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态（#1、#4），根本原因在于 Multus CNI 插件在创建沙箱时（#2）无法解析网络依赖。这一阻塞原因在长达 88 分钟的采集窗口内持续复发（#3），排除了瞬时网络抖动可能，确认为配置缺失导致的持续性故障。由于容器未能成功启动，日志与追踪数据不可用，Kubernetes 层面的状态与事件已成为判断根因的充分且唯一依据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件解析网络失败 → Pod 沙箱创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 启动失败是由于 Multus CNI 插件无法找到其配置中引用的网络附件定义（`network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\"`）。该对象在 Pod 所在的 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在，导致网络插件执行失败并阻止容器启动（证据 #2、#3）。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n无法确定该网络定义（`unavailable-network`）是否本应存在于当前命名空间，还是应存在于其他命名空间，亦或是名称配置有误（如拼写错误或资源名不同）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` | 确认 Pod 处于无法启动容器的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `Failed to create pod sandbox: ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 定位直接失败原因为 Multus CNI 插件未能找到网络配置 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound` (累计 46 次): `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 证实 Pod 反复尝试加载名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件但始终失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: 1 (reason: `ContainerCreating`) | 指标状态印证了容器持续处于等待网络配置的原因 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nPod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态（#1、#4），根本原因在于 Multus CNI 插件在创建沙箱时（#2）无法解析网络依赖。这一阻塞原因在长达 88 分钟的采集窗口内持续复发（#3），排除了瞬时网络抖动可能，确认为配置缺失导致的持续性故障。由于容器未能成功启动，日志与追踪数据不可用，Kubernetes 层面的状态与事件已成为判断根因的充分且唯一依据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件解析网络失败 → Pod 沙箱创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 启动失败是由于 Multus CNI 插件无法找到其配置中引用的网络附件定义（`network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\"`）。该对象在 Pod 所在的 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在，导致网络插件执行失败并阻止容器启动（证据 #2、#3）。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n无法确定该网络定义（`unavailable-network`）是否本应存在于当前命名空间，还是应存在于其他命名空间，亦或是名称配置有误（如拼写错误或资源名不同）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

