data: {"id": "d1bbeef931d0433f-final", "run_id": "d1bbeef931d0433f", "seq": 3486, "ts_ms": 1788783606168, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ContainerCreating` | 确认 Pod 处于无法启动容器的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `Failed to create pod sandbox: ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` | 定位直接失败原因为 Multus CNI 插件未能找到网络配置 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound` (累计 46 次): `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 证实 Pod 反复尝试加载名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件但始终失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: 1 (reason: `ContainerCreating`) | 指标状态印证了容器持续处于等待网络配置的原因 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nPod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态（#1、#4），根本原因在于 Multus CNI 插件在创建沙箱时（#2）无法解析网络依赖。这一阻塞原因在长达 88 分钟的采集窗口内持续复发（#3），排除了瞬时网络抖动可能，确认为配置缺失导致的持续性故障。由于容器未能成功启动，日志与追踪数据不可用，Kubernetes 层面的状态与事件已成为判断根因的充分且唯一依据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n缺少 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件解析网络失败 → Pod 沙箱创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 启动失败是由于 Multus CNI 插件无法找到其配置中引用的网络附件定义（`network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\"`）。该对象在 Pod 所在的 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在，导致网络插件执行失败并阻止容器启动（证据 #2、#3）。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n无法确定该网络定义（`unavailable-network`）是否本应存在于当前命名空间，还是应存在于其他命名空间，亦或是名称配置有误（如拼写错误或资源名不同）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 51.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 44.1s (Evidence 36.0s, RCA 7.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 104.929, "metrics": {"run_id": "d1bbeef931d0433f", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 104.93241214752197, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "47%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 60%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 104932.41214752197, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 94811.31100654602, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 22923.807859420776, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 9688.872337341309}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 51580.85632324219, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 44062.66164779663, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9249.587297439575, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

